> f1(x: u8) = x
> g1(x: u8) = x where x < 5
> equiv f1 ~ g1
f1 and g1 are equal on the domain of f1 (exhaustive)
> f2(x: u8) = x
> g2(x: u8 in 0..7) = x
> equiv f2 ~ g2
f2 and g2 are equal on the domain of f2 (exhaustive)
> f3(x: u8) = x
> g3(x: u8 in {0,1,2,3}) = x
> equiv f3 ~ g3
f3 and g3 are equal on the domain of f3 (exhaustive)
> f4(x: u8) = x
> g4(x: u8) = x where x in {0,1,2,3}
> equiv f4 ~ g4
f4 and g4 are equal on the domain of f4 (exhaustive)
> f5(x: u8) = x
> g5(x: u8) = x where x != 0
> equiv f5 ~ g5
f5 and g5 are equal on the domain of f5 (exhaustive)
> f6(x: u8) = x
> g6(x: u8) = x where x < 3 || x > 250
> equiv f6 ~ g6
f6 and g6 are equal on the domain of f6 (exhaustive)
